OL,3,GNEWSAHead teacher dragged to his death
OL,4,Aunder car, murder trial told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA head teacher was dragged to his death
OL,7,Ffor more than a mile trapped under the
OL,8,Fwheels of a car driven by a man who
OL,9,Fallegedly knew he was there, a jury
OL,10,Fheard.
OL,12,FSimon Richardson, 35, denies the murder
OL,13,Fof 56-year-old Michael Mullins, who was
OL,14,Fstruck and killed as he cycled home
OL,15,Ffrom work on 20 April.
OL,17,FProsecutors claim Richardson stopped
OL,18,Falong the way, tried to dislodge the
OL,19,Finjured but still living cyclist,
OL,20,Fbefore driving on with Mullins
OL,21,Fremaining trapped under the wheels.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
