OL,3,GNEWSAHead teacher dragged to his death
OL,4,Aunder car, murder trial told
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe also denies an alternative count of
OL,7,Fmanslaughter and one of dangerous
OL,8,Fdriving - relating to a police chase
OL,9,Fthe following day - and is standing
OL,10,Ftrial at Manchester Minshull Street
OL,11,FCrown Court.
